<h1>rails-foundation</h1>

<p>
  The foundation is up. This page is public; it exists so the sign-in flow has
  somewhere to land, and so a deploy can be checked by a human as well as by
  <code>/up</code>.
</p>

<% if authenticated? %>
  <p>You are signed in.</p>
  <%= button_to "Sign out", session_path, method: :delete %>
<% else %>
  <p><%= link_to "Sign in", new_session_path %></p>
<% end %>
